{
  "title": "杀猪盘反诈短剧《完美恋人》",
  "duration_seconds": 170.654,
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "晚安，陈默。你也早点休息……今天和你聊天，我很开心。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_000_line_000_linxiaoyu_ae766c40d6a3.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.264,
      "scene_id": "01_after_call"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "刚做好的手冲咖啡，第一杯想给你尝。生活需要一点甜，尤其是遇见你之后。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_001_line_000_chenmo_b8910df6d32c.mp3",
      "start": 6.714,
      "end": 13.962,
      "scene_id": "02_coffee_message"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "隔着屏幕都闻到香了。你每天都这么有仪式感吗？",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_002_line_000_linxiaoyu_cf31f8a39ddf.mp3",
      "start": 14.312,
      "end": 19.208,
      "scene_id": "03_flirty_reply"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "以前没有。等这个项目结束，我飞去见你。我们去大理看洱海，好不好？",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_003_line_000_chenmo_1997024f4816.mp3",
      "start": 19.558,
      "end": 26.686,
      "scene_id": "04_sweet_promise"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "你怎么一会儿纽约，一会儿巴黎？这张铁塔下的照片，还挺帅的。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_004_line_000_linxiaoyu_e41ab7756728.mp3",
      "start": 27.136,
      "end": 33.28,
      "scene_id": "05_browsing_photos"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "工作到处跑，照片都是随手拍的。以后不拍风景了，留着和你一起看。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_005_line_000_chenmo_ec34322f2033.mp3",
      "start": 33.68,
      "end": 41.0,
      "scene_id": "06_future_plan"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "你今天声音不太对。是不是项目又出问题了？要不……我去陪你？",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_006_line_000_linxiaoyu_ae3be1af809e.mp3",
      "start": 41.45,
      "end": 48.29,
      "scene_id": "07_week_later_worry"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "傻瓜，我怎么舍得你奔波。对了，我教你的理财应用试了吗？先投一千，亏了算我的。不是为了赚钱，是让我们的计划快一点。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_007_line_000_chenmo_fcc5a6194b29.mp3",
      "start": 48.79,
      "end": 60.742,
      "scene_id": "08_small_invest_pitch"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "这个平台我没听说过……不过，就一千。那我试一次，你别笑我胆小。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_008_line_000_linxiaoyu_8b701cbe6e98.mp3",
      "start": 61.242,
      "end": 68.25,
      "scene_id": "09_first_transfer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "宝宝你看，五分钟涨了百分之八。我就说你运气好。等月底漏洞修复，机会就没了。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_009_line_000_chenmo_b0fd8d7e45d6.mp3",
      "start": 68.7,
      "end": 76.692,
      "scene_id": "10_fake_profit"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "这次我把全部积蓄都投进去了。你不是想开工作室吗？把五万放进去，这一单做完，首付就有了。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_010_line_000_chenmo_43aa7b9d0aef.mp3",
      "start": 77.242,
      "end": 86.962,
      "scene_id": "11_harvest_pressure"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "五万三……这是我全部的存款。陈默，我有点怕。我们能不能先见面，再谈投资？",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_011_line_000_linxiaoyu_b4718a3acc29.mp3",
      "start": 87.512,
      "end": 95.984,
      "scene_id": "12_all_savings"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "小雨，你相信我。我什么时候让你失望过？做完这单我就飞过去，我们一起去大理。别让犹豫毁掉我们的未来。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_012_line_000_chenmo_ce0d9436e613.mp3",
      "start": 96.534,
      "end": 106.902,
      "scene_id": "13_dali_promise"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "嗯……我信你。五万……确认。等等，苏苏说，这张巴黎照片是网图？",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_013_line_000_linxiaoyu_8edb12bf9f27.mp3",
      "start": 107.502,
      "end": 115.206,
      "scene_id": "14_almost_confirm"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "原博主二零二三年就发过。你说是今年春天拍的……健身房镜子里的手机是苹果十三，可你明明说一直用华为。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_014_line_000_linxiaoyu_f09f0ec2b4e3.mp3",
      "start": 115.856,
      "end": 126.632,
      "scene_id": "15_photo_discovery"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "陈默，银行提示收款账户异常，还标记了高风险。你换一个账号，我马上转。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_015_line_000_linxiaoyu_0cef2abd2e78.mp3",
      "start": 127.282,
      "end": 135.274,
      "scene_id": "16_test_account"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "chenmo",
      "speaker_name": "陈默",
      "text": "怎么可能？就这个账号，我确认过很多次。你是不是不信我？我把所有钱都投进去了，你不转，我们两个都要亏。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_016_line_000_chenmo_6b4e94b0c4f8.mp3",
      "start": 135.824,
      "end": 146.648,
      "scene_id": "17_cold_gaslight"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "漏洞、月底、最后机会……你每句话都在催我。你盯上的不是我，是我的余额。别再联系我了。我已经保存证据，也已经举报。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_017_line_000_linxiaoyu_8e22ce870247.mp3",
      "start": 147.298,
      "end": 159.538,
      "scene_id": "18_report_and_block"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "linxiaoyu",
      "speaker_name": "林小雨",
      "text": "苏苏，谢谢你。差一点，我就把五万块和我对他的信任，一起交出去了。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\perfect_lover_pig_butchering_v1\\final\\perfect_lover_raw.story\\audio\\scene_018_line_000_linxiaoyu_eef85a96c97f.mp3",
      "start": 160.438,
      "end": 167.854,
      "scene_id": "19_friend_thanks"
    }
  ]
}